{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":86,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["求主恩助"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的祈禱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你側耳應允我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我是困苦窮乏的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你保存我的性命，因我是虔誠人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的上帝啊，求你拯救這倚靠你的僕人！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，求你憐憫我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我終日求告你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，求你使僕人心裏歡喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我的心仰望你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，你本為良善，樂意饒恕人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有豐盛的慈愛賜給凡求告你的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你留心聽我的禱告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"垂聽我懇求的聲音。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在患難之日要求告你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你必應允我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"主啊，諸神之中沒有可比你的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的作為也無可比。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，你所造的萬民都要來敬拜你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們也要榮耀你的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你為大，且行奇妙的事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟獨你是上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你將你的道指教我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要照你的真理行；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你使我專心敬畏你的名！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主－我的上帝啊，我要一心稱讚你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要榮耀你的名，直到永遠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為，你向我發的慈愛是大的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你救了我的靈魂免入極深的陰間。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，驕傲的人起來攻擊我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又有一黨強橫的人尋索我的命；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們沒有將你放在眼中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，你是有憐憫有恩典的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不輕易發怒，並有豐盛的慈愛和誠實。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你向我轉臉，憐恤我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將你的力量賜給僕人，救你婢女的兒子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你向我顯出恩待我的憑據，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫恨我的人看見便羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你－耶和華幫助我，安慰我。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/86.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/87.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/85.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}